    "faq_kdNpeD": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_rnf4bC": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "HOW IT WORKS",
            "content": "<p><strong>How does the CELLNERGY Bottle work?</strong><br/>The bottle uses a built-in mineral diffuser to condition your water with three technologies: mineral-based alkalization (pH 8–9.5), molecular hydrogen infusion, and terahertz-frequency water restructuring. Fill with filtered water, wait 15 minutes, and it’s ready to drink.∗</p><p><strong>What makes CELLNERGY different from a regular water bottle?</strong><br/>Standard bottles hold water. The CELLNERGY BOTTLE conditions it. The mineral diffuser actively changes the water’s pH, antioxidant profile, and molecular structure — so what reaches your cells is fundamentally different from what goes in.</p><p><strong>What pH does the CELLNERGY Bottle produce?</strong><br/>The CELLNERGY Bottle conditions water to an alkaline pH of approximately 8–9.5. Most tap and filtered water sits between pH 6.5 and 7.5 — neutral to slightly acidic.</p><p><strong>Does alkaline water change my body’s pH?</strong><br/>No. Your body tightly regulates blood pH on its own. CELLNERGY-conditioned water is not intended to alter blood pH — it’s designed to support hydration efficiency and internal mineral balance as part of a healthy lifestyle.∗</p><p><strong>Why is pH 8–9.5 water beneficial?</strong><br/>Alkaline water in this range may support more efficient hydration and mineral balance compared to neutral or slightly acidic water — helping water interact more effectively with cells, supporting nutrient transport, cellular performance, and overall vitality.∗</p><p><strong>Will I notice a taste difference?</strong><br/>Most users do. CELLNERGY-conditioned water is often described as smoother, cleaner, and lighter. The taste is not flavored or sweetened — it’s the result of a changed mineral and molecular profile.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_aRaGp8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "SAFETY & MATERIALS",
            "content": "<p><strong>Is the CELLNERGY BOTTLE safe?</strong><br/>Yes. The bottle is made from BPA-free, medical-grade Tritan™ — designed for clean, safe everyday hydration. It’s suitable for cold and warm water up to 60°C / 140°F.</p><p><strong>Is alkaline water safe to drink daily</strong>?<br/>Yes. Alkaline water in the pH 8–9.5 range is widely consumed as part of daily hydration routines. If you have a preexisting medical condition or are on medication, we recommend consulting your physician.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_VfTyrJ": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "USAGE",
            "content": "<p><strong>What type of water should I use?</strong><br/>Filtered or purified water is recommended. It allows the conditioning technologies to work most effectively and gives you the cleanest taste.</p><p><strong>How long does conditioning take?</strong><br/>Allow approximately 15 minutes after filling for optimal conditioning. You can then drink throughout the day.</p><p><strong>How often should I use it?</strong><br/>Daily use delivers the best results — especially when taken alongside LifePharm supplements or other frequency regeneration products.</p><p>Can I use it with hot beverages?<br/>The CELLNERGY BOTTLE is designed for cold and warm water only, up to 60°C / 140°F. It is not suitable for boiling or hot liquids.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_cYktUk": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "MINERAL DIFFUSER",
            "content": "<p><strong>Do I need to replace the mineral diffuser?</strong><br/>Yes — we recommend replacing it every 2 months. After approximately 2 months of daily use, mineral output declines and the conditioning performance drops. Replacement diffusers are sold separately.</p><p><strong>What happens if I don’t replace it?</strong><br/>Performance gradually returns to that of a regular water bottle. The minerals don’t expire dangerously — they simply stop conditioning. A fresh diffuser immediately restores full performance.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
